@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Home";
}

<link rel="stylesheet" href="~/css/about.css" />

<main>
    <section class="top-section">
        <div class="top-content">
            <span class="badge">About Reach.A.Paw</span>
            <h1>We Believe Every Tail Deserves a <span>Happy Ending</span></h1>
            <p>Paragraph</p>
            <div class="top-btns">
                <a href="#" class="btn btn-white">Adopt Now</a>
                <a href="#" class="btn btn-outline">Contact Us</a>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="top-image-area">
            <img src="~/assets/dedication.png"  class="top-main-image"/>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="drives-us-container">
        <h2 class="section-title">Our Story</h2>
        <p class="section-description">
            Reach A Paw was born from love, the kind that leaves a permanent paw print on your heart.
            This project is dedicated to my two precious fur babies, my Jojo and Tyson who taught me what unconditional love truly means. They were more than pets; they were comfort on hard days, joy in quiet moments, and a kind of purity that asked for nothing and gave everything. Through their gentle presence, I learned compassion, responsibility, and the quiet power of caring for a life that depends on you.
            Though they are no longer by my side, their love did not end, it transformed. It lives on in this platform, in every rescued paw, every second chance, and every act of kindness Reach A Paw stands for. This project is my way of honoring them, of turning grief into purpose and love into action.
            Reach A Paw reaches for the sky, guided by the little paws that filled my world with love. It exists to plant seeds of love where neglect once grew, and to watch hope bloom anew.
            Forever loved. Forever remembered. Forever the reason this journey began.

        </p>
        <p class="section-description"><italic>— Prastuti 🐾</italic></p>
    </section>
</main>